                        </div>
                    

                    

                    



                    <div id="page-content">
                        

<div style="text-align: right;"><div class="page-rate-widget-box"><span class="rate-points">rating:&nbsp;<span class="number prw54353">-13</span></span><span class="rateup btn btn-default"><a title="I like it" href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.modules.PageRateWidgetModule.listeners.rate(event, 1)">+</a></span><span class="ratedown btn btn-default"><a title="I don't like it" href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.modules.PageRateWidgetModule.listeners.rate(event, -1)">&#8211;</a></span><span class="cancel btn btn-default"><a title="Cancel my vote" href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.modules.PageRateWidgetModule.listeners.cancelVote(event)">x</a></span></div></div>
<div class="scp-image-block block-right" style="width:WIDTH-GOES-HERE;"><img src="https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/750525450379460610/774515350721134612/unknown.png" style="width:WIDTH-GOES-HERE;" alt="unknown.png" class="image" />
<div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:WIDTH-GOES-HERE;">
<p>Artwork of First sighting SCP-5144 by Anne Bookevich</p>
</div>
</div>
<p><strong>Item #:</strong> SCP-5144</p>
<p><strong>AKA:</strong> A Multiversal <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">Joy</span>ride</p>
<p><strong>Object Class:</strong> Safe | Euclid | Keter</p>
<p><strong>Special Containment Procedures:</strong> SCP-5144 is <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">3</span> <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">4</span> 5 separate entities/objects. 5144-2 and 5144-3 have been contained but 5144-1 cannot be contained by any means in this reality (See SCP-5144-1 log for details). SCP-5144-4 is a titanic marble structure located in Iceland that is a gateway to another reality. SCP-5144-5 is an alternate reality of which connected to ours by SCP-5144-4 (See 5144-4 and 5144-5 logs for more details).</p>
<p>The containment cell of SCP-5144-1, 5144-2, and 5144-3, is a large aircraft hangar sized room located 30 meters underground at Site 38. The hangar is partially taken up by SCP-5144-3 due to its size. The entrance to the cell is a 10 by 6 foot sized metal door. Clustered near the entrance are some cushioned chairs and a coffee table. On the walls of the cell are paintings of other worlds and entities. Small statues are scattered around the room. A desk covered in pieces of metal is located near the sculptures, this is where SCP-5144-1 constructs them. The builds resemble miniature models of SCPs that have been used on 5144-1 in termination attempts.</p>
<p><strong>Addendum| First Contact:</strong> Upon March 17th, 20██ at 1:19 PM, SCP-179 was seen pointing toward the planet Neptune. On the far side of the planet, light distortions were visible. The light distortions continued for 2 hours before a massive explosion came from it. The explosion resembled a small supernova, which vaporized about 40% of Neptune's upper atmosphere. Out of the explosion a comet was seen on a direct collision course with Earth. Within 5 minutes, the comet had made it from Neptune to the Moon and slowed drastically. While passing by Mars, a radio transmission was picked up coming from the comet.</p>
<p><strong>Radio Transmission detected:</strong> &quot;Hallo! Hallo! Ist da jemand? Dies ist [DATA LOST] der [DATA LOST] Freiheit, die um Erlaubnis zur Landung bittet! Mein Schiff ist [DATA LOST] beschädigt und ich muss Reparaturen durchführen. Ist [DATA LOST] bewohnbar?! Ich wiederhole: Ist die Erde bewohnbar?!&quot;</p>
<p><strong>Radio Transmission Translation:</strong> &quot;Hello! Hello! Is anyone there? This is the [DATA LOST] of the [DATA LOST] freedom, asking for permission to land! My ship is [DATA LOST] damaged and I need to repair it. Is [DATA LOST] habitable?! I repeat, is Earth habitable ?! &quot;</p>
<p>Attempts to connect to the individual on the radio failed. The anomalous comet continued on its way to Earth, slowing gradually as it entered the atmosphere. At 3:28 the comet crashed in a field near Finley, Tennessee.</p>
<p>A large meteorite is found by researchers sitting in a 10 feet deep crater with the diameter being around 70 meters. The nearby oak forest had been scorched by the crash as well as an abandoned farmhouse. No one seemingly was injured during the crash. The Foundation quickly set up a perimeter around the crater and kept any news media from getting near the meteorite.</p>
<p>March 20th, 20██ at 6:57 PM, 3 days after the meteorite crashed. The meteorite began shaking for 30 seconds before it &quot;turned into water&quot; says one of the researchers who tested the liquid to make sure. Inside the crater now lay a mysterious metal machine surrounded by a puddle of water. Scientists attempted to get samples of the machine but failed, no tools or weapons the Foundation had on site could damage the construct.</p>
<p>March 21st, 20██ at 12:34 PM, loud banging could be heard from inside the machine. D-class personnel was sent in to investigate the noises. The D-class claims to hear voices, yelling, inside the machine. Foundation agents told the D-class to try to make contact with the voice, of which the D-class did. The voice instructed them to locate a cargo bay door and remove and blockages.</p>
<p>The D-class followed the voice to the back of the machine and was instructed by the voice to remove the dirt blocking a large cargo bay door. An armed guard brought the D-class a shovel and they proceeded to remove the dirt. After it was cleared, a loud banging came from inside the cargo bay. 2 minutes of banging went on before the cargo bay door blasted open, heaving the entire machine a few feet in the air. Out of the machine came 2 figures; human male in a tuxedo and a large, dark blue creature (SCP-5144-1 and SCP-5144-2.)</p>
<hr />
<div class="scp-image-block block-right" style="width:WIDTH-GOES-HERE;"><img src="https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/750525450379460610/778444314212171796/wolf_thinggy_idrk_1_half_hours_hhhhhhhhhhhhh.png" style="width:WIDTH-GOES-HERE;" alt="wolf_thinggy_idrk_1_half_hours_hhhhhhhhhhhhh.png" class="image" />
<div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:WIDTH-GOES-HERE;">
<p>SCP-5144-1 digital artwork by Researcher Arthur Johnson</p>
</div>
</div>
<p><strong>Item #:</strong> SCP-5144-1</p>
<p><strong>AKA:</strong> Mozart</p>
<p><strong>Object Class:</strong> <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">Euclid</span> Keter</p>
<p><strong>Special Containment Procedures:</strong> SCP-5144-1 cannot be contained by the Foundation but the lifeform does stay inside 5144's containment cell at Site 38 by choice. The 5144-1 can't be contained because of one of its anomalous abilities (Seen below).</p>
<p><strong>Description:</strong> SCP-5144-1 is a bipedal reptilian lifeform. Approximately 2.5 meters in height and weighs over 200kg. The flesh of the entity is a dark grey and the skin is covered by millions of small, dark blue scales. 5144-1 has a large head, in the shape of a snake head, with a pair of eyes on each side of the skull. Nostrils are located above the front lip. Entity has 4 fangs located inside its maw, 2 inches long each, that secrete the MF-1 substance in extremely concentrated amounts. The eyes glow light blue. The creature can communicate verbally despite a lack of vocal cords or tongue. The chest cavity of the creature is visible with a glowing blue orb floating inside it. The orb does not show up on any scanners however the hume level does. Inside the chest cavity of 5144-1, the hume level rapidly increases and decreases at an unsteady rate, however not affecting the hume level outside the chest cavity. If 5144-1 consumes any item, when the item enters the chest cavity, it is absorbed by the orb.</p>
<p>The lifeform's skeletal structure is constructed entirely of an unknown metal. Attempts to study the metal have failed due to 5144-1's anomalous ability. Whatever the bones are made of seems to have the same density as steel. The creature has only 3 digits on its hands/feet. Upon 5144-1's back are 4 hatches, each 4 inches in diameter, that open to extend long robotic limbs of the same metal the skeleton is constructed from. The limbs can extend up to 2 meters in length and each have a robotic hand on them. The robotic hands have 4 digits each. The robotic limbs can retract back into the body of 5144-1 however there is no visible changes to the chest cavity of the entity. SCP-5144-1 has a large serpentine tail stretching 2.5 meters in length with large plates made of the same skeletal alloy fused to the top.</p>
<p>Adorned on the tip of the tail is a small flower similar to a water lily, however glowing a pink hue. Inside the center of the flower is a cluster of powder known as MF-1 substance. The substance causes sedation if inhaled or consumed. When burned, MF-1 becomes an extremely powerful hallucinogen and sense dampener. SCP-5144-1 seems to be immune to the sedative ability but is still susceptible to the hallucinogen. SCP-5144-1 has its spine protected by smaller plates similar to the ones on its tail. Entity has no digestive organs. The respiratory system of the entity pumps a dark blue blood through the body of unknown means, as no lungs or heart are existent within 5144-1. SCP-5144-1 prefers to be identified as &quot;Mozart&quot;.</p>
<p>SCP-5144-1's origins are unknown. SCP-5144-1's knowledge of its existence is limited.</p>
<p><strong>Behavior:</strong> SCP-5144-1 is a rather benevolent lifeform. It is quite open to the Foundation of its existence however will not talk about a specific time in its past around 10 thousand years before contact. 5144-1 also seems to feel happy by making others feel happy, including trying to cheer up one guard who lost a friend in a containment breach at another site. The SCP seems to want to help the Foundation.</p>
<p>SCP-5144-1 prefers creating things. It will generally will construct canvases then paint detailed images of places it's been to and lifeforms it's seen. It will then try to show staff the paintings and explain the worlds they are of. But when questioned about a painting of a pink reptilian humanoid, 5144-1 refuses to talk. The creature also seems to enjoy constructing metal sculptures of other SCPs, weapons of alien construct, and otherworldly furniture. SCP-5144-1 donates its alien weapons to the researchers to study and possibly distribute to MTF units.</p>
<p>SCP-5144-1 has no sexual attraction to humans. However, it has shown interest in SCP-1472, claiming that Dr. Bright said something about Velociraptors in maid costumes. SCP-5144-1 has sent 4 requests to Dr. Paul Blart for permission to enter SCP-1472, permission has been denied.</p>
<p><strong>Anomalous Properties:</strong> SCP-5144-1 has proven not to be able to die. The central orb cannot be damaged by any known methods. The body of 5144-1 is durable but still destroyable. However when removed from the majority of the body or destroyed, the limbs or remaining body will disintegrate only to reconstruct around the central orb. If any portions are still missing after reconstruction, the nearest object will begin to disintegrate and reconstruct the missing body portions until the body is complete, then cease disintegration of nearest object.</p>
<p>SCP-5144-1 can launch concentrated heat from the palms of its robotic limbs. The beams of heat exceed over 2000 degrees Celsius but the heat stays confined to the 4 inch diameter of the robotic limbs. When activated, four beams of blue light protrude from the central core of 5144-1 and proceed to move through the flesh to connect where the robotic limbs enter the body. It is suggested that the energy is drawn from the central orb, but this theory is not fully proven.</p>
<p>SCP-5144-1 seems to have atom altering abilities. 5144-1 can manipulate the atomic makeup of any item and change it into something else. The manipulation seems to take a great amount of energy from 5144-1. The more complex something is, the harder it is for 5144-1 to change it. A simple glass cup is easier to alter than a motherboard of a computer. When exerting too much energy, 5144-1 will cease life functions, resulting in it falling to the ground, for approximately 25 to 30 seconds before restarting. 5144-1 afterwards will remain unconscious until it has regained its strength.</p>
<p>SCP-5144-1 can open portals to other universes/realities. It does this by firing 4 separate heat beams at a single point. When all four beams connect, it opens a portal that gets larger the longer 5144-1 continues its bombardment. The portals close shortly after being opened. The entity seems not to be able to control the reality that a portal is opened to, however this is possibly not true (See 5144-1 containment breach).</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">|5144-1&nbsp;Containment&nbsp;Breach|</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">|5144-1&nbsp;Containment&nbsp;Breach|</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>SCP-5144-1 Breach</p>
<div class="blockquote">
<p><strong>Breach cause:</strong> SCP-5144-1</p>
<p><strong>&lt;Breach&gt;</strong></p>
<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">On August 26th, 20██ at 7:28 PM</span></p>
<p><strong>Distress call:</strong> &quot;Emergency! This is Dr. Paul Blart. SCP-5144-1 just broke containment! I repeat, 5144-1 has broken containment! Site 38 requesting assistance!&quot;</p>
<p><strong>MTF Command:</strong> &quot;Ok. Dispatching MTF unit Omega-7 to your location. The MTF unit will be there momentarily.&quot;</p>
<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">8:23 PM</span></p>
<p><strong>Omega-7 Commander:</strong> &quot;We have reached Site 38, no fatalities. SCP-5144-1 seems to have broken through the roof of its containment cell. SCP-5144-1 is currently sprinting at 60 miles per hour to an unknown location. We are in pursuit in helicopters with Dr. Paul Blart. SCP-5144-1 is also currently enveloped in a dark red flame!&quot;</p>
<p><strong>MTF Command:</strong> &quot;Continue your pursuit! You have full authorization to attempt to slow 5144-1's movement. Terminate it if you need to.&quot;</p>
<p><strong>Omega-7 Commander:</strong> &quot;Affirmative. *off mic* Omega-7, begin firing upon SCP-5144-1!&quot;</p>
<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">8:44</span></p>
<p><strong>Omega-7 Commander:</strong> &quot;Command, SCP-5144-1 is not slowing its speed. We can't do enough damage up here!&quot;</p>
<p><strong>MTF Command:</strong> &quot;Understood. Attempt to deploy units in 5144-1's path!&quot;</p>
<p><strong>Omega-7 Commander:</strong> &quot;Yes command. *off mic* Deploy MTF in helicopters 2, 3 and 5 in SCP-5144-1's path!&quot;</p>
<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">8:47</span></p>
<p><strong>Omega-7 Commander:</strong> &quot;Command! We have casualties!&quot;</p>
<p><strong>MTF Command:</strong> &quot;What happened?&quot;</p>
<p>**Omega-7 Commander: &quot;SCP-5144-1 disintegrated helicopters 2, 3 and 5, along with all MTF inside them! Its pace has not slowed. SCP-5144-1 also fired an energy beam and took down helicopter 4, no casualties in 4.&quot;</p>
<p><strong>MTF Command:</strong> &quot;Continue pursuit at safe distance!&quot;</p>
<p><strong>Dr. Paul Blart:</strong> *off mic* &quot;Give me that!&quot; *on mic* &quot;MTF Command, is there anything in the direction it's currently heading?!&quot;</p>
<p><strong>MTF Command:</strong> &quot;Site-██ is in its current direction. You are about 120 miles from it.&quot;</p>
<p><strong>Dr. Paul Blart:</strong> &quot;Inform all staff at that site to evacuate! SCP-5144-1 is going to barrel right through it like it did the helicopters!&quot;</p>
<p><strong>MTF Command:</strong> &quot;We will.&quot;</p>
<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">10:45</span></p>
<p><strong>Omega-7 Commander:</strong> &quot;SCP-5144-1 is nearing Site-██ and starting to slow!&quot;</p>
<p><strong>MTF Command:</strong> &quot;Evacuation is in progress. How long until it gets there?&quot;</p>
<p><strong>Omega-7 Commander:</strong> &quot;SCP-5144-1 has stopped! It is currently standing outside the site gate. Wait no, it just disintegrated the gate! I repeat, 5144-1 just disintegrated the gate. It is entering the site.&quot;</p>
<p><strong>MTF Command:</strong> &quot;Remain safe distance. We will warn personnel inside.&quot;</p>
<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">10:51</span></p>
<p><strong>MTF Command:</strong> &quot;We are monitoring the site camera system. SCP-5144-1 has entered researcher Takenaka's office. Takenaka is currently trapped inside with it. SCP-5144-1 is standing across the desk from Takenaka.&quot;</p>
<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">10:53</span></p>
<p><strong>MTF Command:</strong> &quot;SCP-5144-1 just threw Takenaka into the wall and has taken SCP-1762! It is leaving the room.&quot;</p>
<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">11:01</span></p>
<p><strong>Omega-7 Commander:</strong> &quot;Command! We have visual on SCP-5144-1! It has exited the site and is carrying SCP-1762 with a robotic limb coiled around it. The fire encasing 5144-1 is not damaging 1762. Do we engage?&quot;</p>
<p><strong>MTF Command:</strong> &quot;Negative. Remain safe distance but continue pursuing 5144-1.&quot;</p>
<p><strong>Omega-7 Commander:</strong> &quot;Yes Comman-&quot; *loud explosion*</p>
<p><strong>MTF Command:</strong> &quot;Commander? Omega-7 do you copy?!&quot;</p>
<p><strong>Omega-7 Commander:</strong> &quot;Command, helicopter 1 has been shot down. 2 casualties. Helicopters 6, 7, and 8 will continue pursuit.&quot;</p>
<p><strong>MTF Command:</strong> &quot;Affirmative.&quot;</p>
<p><strong>Omega-7 Lieutenant:</strong> &quot;Command, this is helicopter 6. SCP-5144-1 has broken into a sprint approximately 80 miles per hour and rapidly increasing!&quot;</p>
<p><strong>MTF Command:</strong> &quot;Continue pursuit.&quot;</p>
<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">1:36</span></p>
<p><strong>Omega-7 Lieutenant:</strong> &quot;Command. SCP-5144-1 has just reached the Atlantic ocean but shows no sign of stopping. It is freezing the water below it while it's running!&quot;</p>
<p><strong>MTF Command:</strong> &quot;Maintain pursuit. You cannot lose SCP-5144-1.&quot;</p>
<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">3:12</span></p>
<p><strong>Omega-7 Lieutenant:</strong> &quot;Command. SCP-5144-1 has just reached land. Current location is the southwestern side of Iceland. We are also running low on fuel for the helicopters.&quot;</p>
<p><strong>MTF Command:</strong> &quot;Maintain pursuit until yo-&quot;</p>
<p><strong>Omega-7 Lieutenant:</strong> &quot;SCP-5144-1 has stopped! I repeat, 5144-1 has stopped!&quot;</p>
<p><strong>MTF Command:</strong> &quot;Land a safe distance from SCP-5144-1.&quot;</p>
<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">4:19</span></p>
<p><strong>Dr. Paul Blart:</strong> &quot;SCP-5144-1 is currently in a kneeling position in front of SCP-1762, which is a few feet from it.&quot;</p>
<p><strong>Omega-7 Lieutenant:</strong> &quot;Dr. Blart. Stay away from 5144-1.&quot;</p>
<p><strong>MTF Command:</strong> &quot;What is happening?&quot;</p>
<p><strong>Dr. Paul Blart:</strong> &quot;SCP-5144-1 just stood up!&quot;</p>
<p><strong>Unknown voice:</strong> &quot;<em>YOU DON'T GET TO ABANDON HUMANITY!</em>&quot;</p>
<p><strong>MTF Command:</strong> &quot;What what that!?&quot;</p>
<p><strong>Omega-7 Lieutenant:</strong> &quot;SCP-5144-1 just threw SCP-1762! 1762 got 70 meters or so before 5144-1 began firing energy beams at it!&quot;</p>
<p><strong>Dr. Paul Blart:</strong> &quot;He&#8230; He's crossing the beams!&quot;</p>
<p><strong>MTF Command:</strong> &quot;What does that mean?&quot;</p>
<p><strong>Dr. Paul Blart:</strong> &quot;He said that crossing the beams opens-&quot;</p>
<p><strong>Omega-7 Lieutenant:</strong> &quot;Command! A bright light is coming from SCP-1762's locatio- *a loud explosive noise* COMMAND! A giant beam of light is shooting into the sky where 1762 was!&quot;</p>
<p><strong>MTF Command:</strong> &quot;We are connecting to your body cams.&quot;</p>
<p><strong>Dr. Paul Blart:</strong> &quot;The beam&#8230; its getting bigger! It just enveloped SCP-5144-1!&quot;</p>
<p><strong>MTF Command:</strong> &quot;Get out of there!&quot;</p>
<p><strong>Omega-7 Lieutenant:</strong> *off mic* &quot;Get those choppers in the air NOW!&quot;</p>
<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">4:29</span></p>
<p><strong>MTF Command:</strong> &quot;Hello? Lieutenant?&quot;</p>
<p><strong>Dr. Paul Blart:</strong> &quot;We barely made it out of there but the helicopters are practically out of fuel. Command&#8230; the beam shooting in the sky is now about 2 fucking kilometers large!&quot;</p>
<p><strong>MTF Command:</strong> *off mic* &quot;Guys look out the window&#8230;&quot; &quot;Jesus christ!&quot; *on mic* &quot;We have visual on the beam of light. Where is the lieutenant?&quot;</p>
<p><strong>Dr. Paul Blart:</strong> &quot;The lieutenant is gone. He was absorbed by the beam of light. As well as helicopter 8. The beam has stopped growing in size and I can see movement inside it.&quot;</p>
<p><strong>MTF Command:</strong> &quot;Are you a safe distance?!&quot;</p>
<p><strong>Dr. Paul Blart:</strong> &quot;Yes.&quot;</p>
<p><strong>MTF Command:</strong> &quot;Ok. We are sending help.&quot;</p>
<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">6:48</span></p>
<p><strong>Dr. Paul Blart:</strong> &quot;Command! There is some kind of structure inside the beam of light! I can see something in there. Something big. It just stopped! Command the beam of light is gone! Oh&#8230; oh my god!&quot;</p>
<p><strong>MTF Command:</strong> &quot;Blart? What is happening?&quot;</p>
<p><strong>Dr. Paul Blart:</strong> &quot;Holy shit! There is a titanic shape where the beam of light was! It&#8230; it looks to be made out of some sort of white material.&quot;</p>
<p><strong>MTF Command:</strong> &quot;How big is the structure?&quot;</p>
<p><strong>Dr. Paul Blart:</strong> &quot;Command. Its the fucking size of the beam! WAIT! Oh god where is 5144-1?!&quot; *the mic is heard dropping to the floor*</p>
<p><strong>Omega-7 Cadet:</strong> &quot;C.. Command? Dr. Blart just ran off toward the structure. What should I do?&quot;</p>
<p><strong>MTF Command:</strong> &quot;Stay there. Help should be arriving shortly.&quot;</p>
<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">7:12</span></p>
<p><strong>Omega-7 Cadet:</strong> &quot;Command. Dr. Blart is back. He dragged SCP-5144-1 behind him. Here he is.&quot;</p>
<p><strong>Dr. Paul Blart:</strong> &quot;Command.&quot;</p>
<p><strong>MTF Command:</strong> &quot;Blart what happened?! Why did you leave?&quot;</p>
<p><strong>Dr. Paul Blart:</strong> &quot;I went to the structure and found 5144-1 passed out on the floor. The structure is massive. Get researchers out here now! We need to know what this thing is!&quot;</p>
<p><strong>&lt;Breach Secured&gt;</strong></p>
</div>
</div>
