<p><strong>Interviews of SCP-5144-1:</strong></p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Interview&nbsp;1</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Interview&nbsp;1</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<div class="blockquote">
<p><strong>Interviewed:</strong> SCP-5144-1| AKA: Mozart</p>
<p><strong>Interviewer:</strong> Arthur Johnson | Level 4 researcher</p>
<p><strong>Foreword:</strong> 5144-1 was questioned of its existence and reason for coming to Earth.</p>
<p><strong>&lt;Begin Log, March 23rd, 20██ at 5:30 PM&gt;</strong></p>
<p><strong>Arthur:</strong> &quot;Hello SCP-5144-1. I hear you like being called Mozart, is that correct?&quot;</p>
<p><strong>5144-1:</strong> &quot;Yes, that is correct.&quot;</p>
<p><strong>Arthur:</strong> &quot;Ok. Now we have wanted to know, Why did you come here? To this planet I mean.&quot;</p>
<p><strong>5144-1:</strong> &quot;Alright big backstory time with Mozart. So a few&#8230; what about 30,000 years ago? Sorry I stopped counting after 700. I just woke up I guess? I don't remember anything before then, just waking up and started existing.</p>
<p><strong>Arthur:</strong> &quot;Ok. *Arthur wrote down the date in his notebook* Now please continue.&quot;</p>
<p><strong>5144-1:</strong> &quot;I woke up in the void I guess? No stars, no noise, just nothingness. In my hand I clutched a tiny metal disk. After a few minutes of understanding what it felt like to move limbs, I fumbled with the disk and a little hologram turned on.</p>
<p>A tiny figure stood on the disk. He had one eye and some funny horns, as well as a slightly uh&#8230; large body. Actually I can show you the hologram. *SCP-5144-1 placed the disk on the table and turned it on*</p>
<p>(See Hologram Message)</p>
<p>I was so confused after watching that but after a few months floating in space with the ability to not die, I learned how to harness my abilities. Somehow I knew already how to speak and how to use my abilities. I gotta say though, it was a weird experience. Anyways, I learned how to open portals and entered a new universe.</p>
<p><strong>Arthur:</strong> *Arthur was staring at 5144-1 before snapping out of it* &quot;Wow&#8230; that must have been a very odd experience. How did you specifically get to our universe though?&quot;</p>
<p><strong>5144-1:</strong> &quot;Oh right! Me and Amidias are on a conquest across the cosmos. Like a multiversal joyride. We uh&#8230; ran into some trouble. I was kinda was in the middle of a military space battle. Bullets and missiles flying everywhere. I just got stuck in the middle of it when it started and had to open a rift to get out of there. However, my ship was hit by a rogue missile and that's why it looked like a ball of fire coming down here.&quot;</p>
<p><strong>Arthur:</strong> &quot;Jeez, that is something else. Why was there fighting?&quot;</p>
<p><strong>5144-1:</strong> &quot;Some alien lifeforms having a weird dispute over space and territory I think.&quot;</p>
<p><strong>Arthur:</strong> &quot;Wow. Thanks Mozart, this has been quite an enlightening interview.&quot;</p>
<p><strong>5144-1:</strong> &quot;No problem dude. See ya later.&quot;</p>
<p><strong>&lt;End Log, March 23rd, 20██ at 5:40 PM&gt;</strong></p>
<p><strong>Closing Statement:</strong> SCP-5144-1 is an interdimensional traveler that does not know how it even exists.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Interview&nbsp;2</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Interview&nbsp;2</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<div class="blockquote">
<p><strong>Interviewed:</strong> SCP-5144-1| AKA: Mozart</p>
<p><strong>Interviewer:</strong> Linda Brooke | Level 3 Researcher</p>
<p><strong>Foreword:</strong> SCP-5144-1 was interviewed before a test of its atom restructuring abilities.</p>
<p><strong>&lt;Begin Log, April 2nd, 20██ at 10:45 AM&gt;</strong></p>
<p><strong>Linda:</strong> &quot;Hello SCP-5144-1, my name is Linda. We have some questions for you then we want to test your anomalous abilities. Is that ok?&quot;</p>
<p><strong>5144-1:</strong> &quot;Sure doc, ask away.&quot;</p>
<p><strong>Linda:</strong> &quot;We have some questions about SCP-5144-3, your ship. What is it constructed of?&quot;</p>
<p><strong>5144-1:</strong> &quot;Er&#8230; Don't remember. I bought it from some guy in the Messier 82 galaxy.&quot;</p>
<p><strong>Linda:</strong> &quot;Interesting. *Linda writes on her notepad* Ok now there were some odd items inside your ship. Starting with the cargo bay, what was in there?&quot;</p>
<p><strong>SCP-5144-1:</strong> &quot;Oh yea! The fruit crates in there I picked up on an uncharted planet a few lightyears from where Earth should have been. I didn't check though. There should have also been my fancy knife somewhere in there&#8230; I think that's everything in the cargo bay.&quot;</p>
<p><strong>Linda:</strong> *Finishes writing notes down* &quot;Ok now there were also some lockers in the top level of 5144-3 containing many different items. Can you explain what they are and why you have some of them?&quot;</p>
<p><strong>5144-1:</strong> &quot;There's some canned meat and water in there. &quot;</p>
<p><strong>5144-1:</strong> &quot;Lets see, there's the laser rifle I got in there&#8230; <em>Oh God not the grenades!</em>&quot;</p>
<p><strong>Linda:</strong> &quot;Calm down. 5144-2 left you a note in the locker to remind you what they were. We did not touch them.&quot;</p>
<p>*5144-1 sat back down in his seat*</p>
<p><strong>5144-1:</strong> &quot;Phew. Ok I think the last thing is a mirror? I don't remember where I got it.&quot;</p>
<p><strong>Linda:</strong> &quot;Wait, we found something else in one of the lockers. A photo album with pictures you and another lifeform waving at the camera. Can you tell us what this is?&quot;</p>
<p><strong>5144-1:</strong> &quot;I&#8230;I really rather not talk about it&#8230;&quot;</p>
<p>*a tear drips down 5144-1's cheek.*</p>
<p><strong>Linda:</strong> &quot;Ok, I see it is a hard topic for you. Let's move onto the experiment. Please follow me.&quot;</p>
<p>*Linda led SCP-5144-1 into an empty room with a coffee table and a pile of dirt on it.*</p>
<p><strong>Linda:</strong> &quot;Alright. We want to test your atom altering abilities. Can you please turn the pile of dirt into anything that comes to mind.&quot;</p>
<p><strong>5144-1:</strong> &quot;<em>Anything?</em> Ok then, I got an idea.&quot;</p>
<p>*Linda proceeded to back away as 5144-1's mechanical arms and palms started to glow. Then 5144-1 raised his right hand to aim at the pile of dirt and the dirt started to float slowly, particle by particle, into the air. 5144-1 then blasted the floating dirt with 1 beam of light from its arm, completely obliterating the floating mass.</p>
<p>5144-1 then proceeded to raise all 4 mechanical arms on its back to face the same way his arm was aimed. Then the palm of his hand as well as the centers of the 4 robotic arms started emitting blue waves of light visible in the air. The waves crossed the room toward the area where the pile of dirt had been floating. Quickly the air around the location of where the dirt was started to distort as a tiny construct was becoming visible. The atoms had been in the air around the room and now were rejoining into something else. 2 minutes went by before 5144-1 was complete.</p>
<p>After 5144-1 stopped emitting blue light waves, a gold microwave lay atop the coffee table. 5144-1 immediately passed out on the floor after the microwave was complete. The process seems to take an immense amount of energy from 5144-1.*</p>
<p><strong>Linda:</strong> &quot;Get a stroller, move him back to his containment cell and&#8230;. Uh, move the microwave there too.&quot;</p>
<p><strong>&lt;End Log, April 2nd, 20██ at 11:02 AM&gt;</strong></p>
<p><strong>Closing Statement:</strong> SCP-5144-1 can manipulate atoms of any item but requires a great amount of energy. <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">A golden microwave is currently the most complex item it has created while in foundation custody.</span></p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Interview&nbsp;3</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Interview&nbsp;3</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<div class="blockquote">
<p><strong>Interviewed:</strong> SCP-5144-1| AKA: Mozart</p>
<p><strong>Interviewer:</strong> Arthur Johnson | Level 4 Researcher</p>
<p><strong>Foreword:</strong> After waking from his comatose state, 5144-1 was interviewed about the incident.</p>
<p><strong>&lt;Begin Log, October 30th, 20██ at 4:33 PM&gt;</strong></p>
<p><strong>Arthur:</strong> &quot;Hello Mozart. How are you feeling?&quot;</p>
<p><strong>5144-1:</strong> &quot;Ugh&#8230; I feel kind of drained. What happened?&quot;</p>
<p><strong>Arthur:</strong> &quot;Actually, we were hoping you would know. Why did you breach containment?&quot;</p>
<p><strong>5144-1:</strong> &quot;What!? Um, I don't know what you're talking about.&quot;</p>
<p><strong>Arthur:</strong> &quot;You disintegrated the ceiling and ran off toward Site ██, then took an item from there and made your way to-&quot;</p>
<p><strong>5144-1:</strong> &quot;Wait what? Dude, I was here.&quot;</p>
<p><strong>Arthur:</strong> &quot;Look up.&quot;</p>
<p>*5144-1 looked to the roof and saw the 6 meter wide hole it made.*</p>
<p><strong>5144-1:</strong> &quot;Oh dear. This isn't some joke. But wait, how did I do that? I should have dropped right outside the hole from the energy use&#8230;&quot;</p>
<p><strong>Arthur:</strong> &quot;Yes we thought the same thing but you surprised us all.&quot;</p>
<p><strong>5144-1:</strong> &quot;Oh no! I didn't hurt anybody did I?&quot;</p>
<p><strong>Arthur:</strong> &quot;You disintegrated an entire MTF squad&#8230;&quot;</p>
<p><strong>5144-1:</strong> &quot;Oh god.&quot;</p>
<p><strong>Arthur:</strong> &quot;Mozart, what do you remember.&quot;</p>
<p><strong>5144-1:</strong> &quot;I was sitting on the couch reading some SCP articles on an iPad. Wait, there was something else. Right before I&#8230;&quot;</p>
<p><strong>Arthur:</strong> &quot;We looked at the iPad after we got you back here. You were reading an article about SCP-1762.&quot;</p>
<p><strong>5144-1:</strong> &quot;What one was that? Some sort of bo- Box, a box&#8230; why does that seem so familiar.&quot; *5144-1 got up and started pacing around before gasping loudly* &quot;<em>I remember!</em>&quot;</p>
<p><strong>Arthur:</strong> &quot;You remember what?&quot;</p>
<p><strong>5144-1:</strong> &quot;The box, the box of dragons. It&#8230; it's coming back to me. The article made me feel s&#8230; sad? Yea, I kinda wished I could have done something. But what?&quot;</p>
<p><strong>Arthur:</strong> &quot;Do you have memory problems frequently?&quot;</p>
<p><strong>5144-1:</strong> &quot;No very rarely&#8230; A weird dream&#8230; <em>why</em> does something not seem righ-&quot; *5144-1 stopped abruptly and then muttered something unintelligible* &quot;I&#8230; I'm sorry Arthur I need to go.&quot; *5144-1 then ran toward 5144-3 and boarded it, closing the cargo bay behind it.*</p>
<p><strong>Arthur:</strong> &quot;Mozart wait! We are in the middle of an interview.&quot;</p>
<p><strong>&lt;End Log, October 30th, 20██ at 4:37 PM&gt;</strong></p>
<p><strong>Closing Statement:</strong> Some data about the breach was uncovered but not enough to find out why 5144-1 breached containment.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
