<div class="scp-image-block block-right" style="width:WIDTH-GOES-HERE;"><img src="https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/750525450379460610/774510926774403085/unknown.png" style="width:WIDTH-GOES-HERE;" alt="unknown.png" class="image" />
