<div class="scp-image-block block-right" style="width:WIDTH-GOES-HERE;"><img src="https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/750525450379460610/777271906080129054/unknown.png" style="width:WIDTH-GOES-HERE;" alt="unknown.png" class="image" />
<div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:WIDTH-GOES-HERE;">
<p>Artwork of SCP-5144-4 by Anne Bookevich</p>
